      "message": "Is it correct to say that if a permission is in requestedPermissions, then the app has that permission? The code in PermissionMonitor#hasPermission suggests that it is not, we need to check requestedPermissionsFlags too.\n\nNo need to fix in this CL since this is just a test, and not a security-sensitive test, but should probably fix it. In particular it would be bad if someone copied this code and put it somewhere that is actually security-sensitive. Maybe we could add a hasPermission utility method in frameworks/libs/net somewhere, since this is non-obvious and error-prone?\n\nThis method too would be a good fit for frameworks/libs/net.",
